helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	nn	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:NUMERICFIELD:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:NF_SIZE7\"\>Bruk talboksane \<emph\>Storleik 1\</emph\> til \<emph\>Storleik 7\</emph\> for å velja skriftstorleikar for HTML-taggane <font size=1> til <font size=7>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
