helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	nn	Vel \<emph\>Rediger → Overgangstoning\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	nn	Vel talet på nye objekt mellom dei to opphavlege objekta i talboksen \<emph\>Steg\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
